<TH ALIGN="CENTER" VALIGN="MIDDLE" WIDTH="145" HEIGHT="53" ACOPYCOL="N" ADELETECOL="N" AMOVECOL="N" AUPDATECONT="N">제3자배정 증자의 목적</TH>
